{"TV|\u2026and it\u2019s a packed house for the crosstown rivalry \u2014 Churchill vs Wooton, THE BIG GAME!": "assets/voice/0cb104e7c4bc.mp3", "Christian|Classic. Half the county is at that game right now.": "assets/voice/784e8c7657c2.mp3", "TV|Bulldogs driving down the field \u2014 Wooton\u2019s defense is gonna have to dig in\u2026": "assets/voice/88ebae720fe4.mp3", "Agent|Welcome to Dulles! Flight home for the holidays?": "assets/voice/6496781cdc3e.mp3", "Christian|You know it. Back in MoCo for the week.": "assets/voice/fa8904679910.mp3", "Christian|One large coffee, please. It's going to be a long day.": "assets/voice/3f05963033ac.mp3", "Agent|Holiday travel, huh? You look like you've got a whole saga ahead of you. Good luck out there.": "assets/voice/b98a88ead24c.mp3", "The Pilot|Rough approach in that crosswind, huh? Dulles in December \u2014 never a dull moment.": "assets/voice/01d4a01fd596.mp3", "Christian|You got us down smooth. Appreciate it, captain.": "assets/voice/ae6b0ad4316c.mp3", "The Pilot|Enjoy the holidays. And drive safe \u2014 the 267 is a skating rink tonight.": "assets/voice/0440c69cae7b.mp3", "Christian|Babe never changes. All right \u2014 Olivia\u2019s first, then the swap. Let\u2019s roll.": "assets/voice/8958305f8d47.mp3", "Christian|Four dollars for a water. Airport prices never change.": "assets/voice/e1946a59d8c0.mp3", "Stacy|Get the pretzels. You always get the pretzels.": "assets/voice/5b6d9faa21b2.mp3", "Christian|Delayed, delayed, delayed... ours was the only one that landed early. Figures.": "assets/voice/a4b3102b8598.mp3", "Christian|There it is. The metal bird that carried me out of LA sunshine and into a Maryland winter.": "assets/voice/71c39cc4a452.mp3", "Christian|Seven dollar coffee. I missed you, east coast. I think.": "assets/voice/c7ac0ba55470.mp3", "Christian|Everybody at Dulles is either coming home or leaving it. Guess which one I am.": "assets/voice/9edec23f4efa.mp3", "Christian|Hey babe \u2014 just landed.": "assets/voice/dcbba0cd47d5.mp3", "Stacy|Babe, finally! Are you coming to the swap later today?": "assets/voice/1cf09f205648.mp3", "Christian|Of course. Headed there now.": "assets/voice/848003cc951e.mp3", "Stacy|Great \u2014 can you swing by Olivia\u2019s? She has a few items she wanted to bring.": "assets/voice/1cc9807c2e28.mp3", "Christian|No problem.": "assets/voice/64ebbe8a350b.mp3", "Stacy|Drive safe, it\u2019s snowing! See you at the swap \u2764\ufe0f": "assets/voice/c46cb0117e4e.mp3", "Mark|Hey guys!": "assets/voice/9709e3d4f5de.mp3", "Kylie \u2764\ufe0f|Let\u2019s go ice-skating! We heard you\u2019ve had a long day and have a lot to catch up on.": "assets/voice/a7eabd6350ee.mp3", "Christian|You have NO idea. Airports, sushi, two Olivias, a basement guy\u2026": "assets/voice/f42c9117fdf6.mp3", "Mark|\u2026two WHAT?": "assets/voice/540959ceb521.mp3", "Christian|On the ice. I\u2019ll tell you on the ice.": "assets/voice/7ade4bb446d6.mp3", "Christian|Before anything \u2014 these are yours. All five. The house was\u2026 thorough.": "assets/voice/0158ad77d62a.mp3", "Olivia|YOU FOUND THEM. Okay. Okay!! The full moon is TONIGHT and you actually came through \u2014": "assets/voice/83583cfee132.mp3", "Olivia|Wait. Did anything weird happen while you were looking? Did you run into\u2026 anyone?": "assets/voice/22404dc4d6f4.mp3", "Christian|You mean the other one? Yeah. She says she never loses anything.": "assets/voice/256cee1c4ee7.mp3", "Olivia|\u2026she would say that. Anyway. Under a full moon, crystals charged, owe you one. Big one.": "assets/voice/c0a8e5efaf32.mp3", "Olivia|Christian! You made it! \u2014 yes, THAT Olivia. The real one. Probably.": "assets/voice/58703a5a124b.mp3", "Mark|Same time next year?": "assets/voice/ec73cc786be0.mp3", "Kylie \u2764\ufe0f|Same time every year. This is the whole point.": "assets/voice/107e56ea6ce9.mp3", "Stacy|Carty Party \u2014 a MoCo holiday. Wouldn\u2019t miss it.": "assets/voice/66b4edefa5d2.mp3", "Christian|Wouldn\u2019t trade it. Not even for a warm basement.": "assets/voice/2386e85f8039.mp3", "\u2014 fin \u2014|Thanks for playing Carty Party: A MoCo Holiday. See you at the swap.": "assets/voice/30059fbaadc3.mp3", "Christian|Five hundred feet of marble lit up against the snow. This city does know how to do a skyline.": "assets/voice/a87300faba61.mp3", "Christian|Respectable carrot work. Whoever built this has built snowmen before.": "assets/voice/2d286ebc45dc.mp3", "Christian|Some of these people are genuinely good. I will not be one of them.": "assets/voice/d4764075d569.mp3", "Christian|One cocoa, extra marshmallows. It's freezing out here.": "assets/voice/a3e606660c99.mp3", "Stacy|This is the best part of winter in DC and I will not be taking questions.": "assets/voice/aa15f64966cc.mp3", "Christian|Cold night. Warm crowd. Best kind of December.": "assets/voice/1d66d152ba99.mp3", "Stacy|Everybody squeeze in \u2014 Christian, stop blinking this time!": "assets/voice/bc2411323101.mp3", "Christian|That was ONE time. The flash was in my eyes.": "assets/voice/ddc20c816a85.mp3", "Christian|Every year I forget how quiet the mall gets in the snow. The whole city holding its breath.": "assets/voice/34c85dfd1bc0.mp3", "Christian|Somebody out there is doing a triple salchow. Somebody else is clinging to the wall. No in-between.": "assets/voice/e15b9e323537.mp3", "Christian|LA does not have this. LA has traffic and vibes. This \u2014 this is a proper December.": "assets/voice/1048b750ee03.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Olivia! Come in, come in. The family is in Miami this weekend \u2014 but YOU have teeth to clean first.": "assets/voice/3df26a37e245.mp3", "Olivia|Wait \u2014 I'm the dentist here?? I thought I had an appointment.": "assets/voice/6ded2fc5d790.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Details, details. Sit in the chair \u2014 the glunk isn't going to scrape itself. And work fast\u2026": "assets/voice/ce0b7ef97111.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|\u2026because if you're too slow, we bring in the OTHER Olivia. And nobody wants that confusion.": "assets/voice/cab8b2c513a3.mp3", "Christian|Is that my skull? That is weirdly my skull. My skull has a skeleton inside it. I do not love knowing that.": "assets/voice/ee87ee57f02a.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Beautiful pano. Look at those roots. You could hang a hammock between those molars.": "assets/voice/35738f7bfbe5.mp3", "Christian|The color wall. Every kid in Montgomery County has stood here paralyzed by this exact decision.": "assets/voice/1d90b89a95e6.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Holiday colors are popular this week. The green and red combo. Very festive. Very committed.": "assets/voice/32a280e8643b.mp3", "Christian|Three diplomas, one seal each. This man is more certified than a parachute.": "assets/voice/d6135d1059a4.mp3", "Christian|Dr. Fritz, DDS. Magna cum laude. And a certificate in orthodontics. And one in sandwich artistry?? Hang on.": "assets/voice/090b7e567195.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|A man contains multitudes. Sit down.": "assets/voice/b4d467425c8b.mp3", "Christian|Picks, mirrors, scrapers. Arranged by size like a tiny terrifying orchestra.": "assets/voice/bd5c7a11ca3f.mp3", "Christian|Highlights magazine from 2019. The hidden pictures are already circled. Every single one. Monsters.": "assets/voice/014af6dab4ce.mp3", "Olivia|Dr. Fritz gives out the good toothbrushes. Not the floppy ones. The good ones.": "assets/voice/bbf6f272cb23.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Every tooth \u2014 sparkling! Not a speck of glunk left. You know what that means\u2026": "assets/voice/f22608a07c68.mp3", "Olivia|Miami??": "assets/voice/e0225984cd05.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|MIAMI. With the philly fam. And tonight \u2014 you dance at Eleven. You earned it.": "assets/voice/0d81e9b11bd5.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Clean\u2026 but slow. The other Olivia was ALREADY in the parking lot. Close one. Miami \u2014 but she's coming too.": "assets/voice/46333eef9904.mp3", "Dr. Fritz|Too slow! OTHER OLIVIA \u2014 get in here! You, out of the chair. Come back when your wrists are faster.": "assets/voice/0f1e0531b9da.mp3", "Christian|Okay \u2014 car smells like winter. First stop Olivia\u2019s, then the swap in Baltimore.": "assets/voice/a827fa7a5c06.mp3", "Christian|Let\u2019s see what\u2019s on the radio\u2026": "assets/voice/118d94771d5f.mp3", "Passenger|Hey! Thanks for stopping \u2014 no time to waste.": "assets/voice/54e757f6ef3d.mp3", "Passenger|I just ordered from Yo Yogi, but they close in 20 minutes. I\u2019ll pay you double if you can get there.": "assets/voice/8bb0a428cae4.mp3", "Christian|No problem \u2014 I\u2019m heading that way now. Buckle in, bronco.": "assets/voice/255ca2540ea7.mp3", "Passenger|They\u2019re closing\u2026 we missed it. Ah man.": "assets/voice/e7e2ab384261.mp3", "Christian|\u2026Or did we? Watch this. (You can retry \u2014 I believe in us.)": "assets/voice/97321cbba70a.mp3", "Passenger|YO YOGI! There \u2014 the little sushi spot with the fogged-up windows! You made it!": "assets/voice/a263fd6994b8.mp3", "Passenger|Thanks, Christian. Seriously.": "assets/voice/90c1eb516abc.mp3", "Christian|No problem. Forget about the tip, though.": "assets/voice/093359306918.mp3", "Passenger|All right\u2026 but here \u2014 free roll of sushi. You earned it, bronco.": "assets/voice/62db13334b4e.mp3", "Christian|Okay. NOW to Olivia\u2019s. Baltimore after that.": "assets/voice/159f5b5ef773.mp3", "Christian|Sixty feet of bar and there is still a wait. The economy of thirst in here is unmatched.": "assets/voice/8bccef0df77b.mp3", "Mark|pro tip: the far end of the bar. nobody walks that far. it is always open. you are welcome.": "assets/voice/cf3dc6104219.mp3", "Christian|VIP mezzanines on three sides. Up there you watch the crowd like weather. Down here you ARE the weather.": "assets/voice/169cf43b0628.mp3", "Christian|The d&b stacks. Ti\u00ebsto personally recommended this system. Tiesto. Personally. I feel that in my skeleton.": "assets/voice/c9298a8aa265.mp3", "Christian|Shift is done. I am off the clock \u2014 the dance floor calls.": "assets/voice/aa487afc3e49.mp3", "Manager|Christian! Tonight you are behind the stick at the biggest club in DC. Orders up top \u2014 pour fast, pour right.": "assets/voice/7437b2cdf943.mp3", "Christian|One night only. Let us make it legendary.": "assets/voice/2743d30d5c92.mp3", "Christian|Echostage. Voted best club in the world, and standing in front of that wall you understand exactly why.": "assets/voice/d7a6eb859fa4.mp3", "Christian|Warehouse outside, cathedral inside. Queens Chapel Rd keeps its secrets well.": "assets/voice/20b6f9fe43b7.mp3", "Christian|Nobody in here is thinking about tomorrow. That is the whole point of this place.": "assets/voice/abad388a4be5.mp3", "Christian|Echostage bartender: one night only. What a room to do it in.": "assets/voice/3daba16f9e3d.mp3", "Stacy|Five for five! Full panels, clean data. This is going in the winter semester writeup.": "assets/voice/73fd5400f34d.mp3", "Christian|You make science look like a sport. A very precise, slightly nerdy sport.": "assets/voice/79ca44057261.mp3", "Stacy|Time! Ugh \u2014 partial data. Science is patient. I am not, but science is.": "assets/voice/a0740e4915d4.mp3", "Christian|The fume hood. For science too dangerous for open air. What are you people cooking in here?": "assets/voice/f1fdc0f35acb.mp3", "Stacy|Sulfur dioxide reactions, mostly. It smells like a volcano's armpit. That is how you know it is working.": "assets/voice/ecae48f5d7f8.mp3", "Christian|The periodic table. Element 92 flavors of nope arranged in a grid. Stacy knows them by heart. By HEART.": "assets/voice/5f52b02e8b9b.mp3", "Stacy|Tell me the atomic number of molybdenum. ...Exactly. Sit down.": "assets/voice/13b6afc62a6c.mp3", "Christian|Field data due Friday. In red. Underlined. The most terrifying sentence in environmental science.": "assets/voice/87a9229f144b.mp3", "Stacy|Water samples from five stations, sixty seconds on the clock. This is what the grant is for. Probably.": "assets/voice/b247925dcf6a.mp3", "Christian|Collect all five before time runs out. Hopkins did not know what it was in for.": "assets/voice/558532bbf009.mp3", "Stacy|Grow lights on a timer, seedlings in rows. My winter cover crop study lives here.": "assets/voice/0ff4651b25be.mp3", "Christian|Every jar is a little time capsule. Science is just very organized hoarding.": "assets/voice/537775ebacdc.mp3", "Stacy|Organized hoarding with peer review. That one is a crayfish from the Patapsco. He is doing great, thank you for asking.": "assets/voice/941a7b0d12b6.mp3", "Stacy|Do not touch the green one. Actually do not touch any of them. Science in progress.": "assets/voice/915695685e66.mp3", "Stacy|Homewood campus after dark. Baltimore does winter better than people admit.": "assets/voice/713e39c2b23f.mp3", "Christian|Hi \u2014 I\u2019m Christian. Here to pick something up for the swap later.": "assets/voice/c8671dd77134.mp3", "Jim|She\u2019s upstairs.": "assets/voice/9b7df650f554.mp3", "Jim|\u2026Help yourself to a cookie on the way out. The Olivias made them.": "assets/voice/d02363d2844e.mp3", "Christian|\u2026the Olivias? Plural??": "assets/voice/33fa731875ae.mp3", "Jim|You\u2019ll see. Go on up.": "assets/voice/f61789d30150.mp3", "Christian|That is a proper fire. Jim does not mess around with the fire.": "assets/voice/a2c3f517f2c5.mp3", "Jim|Thirty years of perfect fires, and all I get is grief about the thermostat.": "assets/voice/3a7a2dcf8e53.mp3", "Christian|Okay these are genuinely incredible. Which Olivia made them??": "assets/voice/42f4d05da58c.mp3", "Jim|Yes.": "assets/voice/a261136ddb46.mp3", "Christian|This screen is genuinely beautiful. Black lacquer, gold paint. Where does one even\u2014": "assets/voice/cdbd487a9f15.mp3", "Olivia|Estate sale. The woman running it said it was \"a lot.\" I said I KNOW. That is the POINT.": "assets/voice/1161e0faf224.mp3", "Christian|This mirror is enormous. You can see the whole room in it.": "assets/voice/dac9b64c8c34.mp3", "Olivia|Mirrors multiply the light. And the people. Sometimes I look in it and count wrong.": "assets/voice/8282be2ec2ef.mp3", "Christian|\u2026what was that last part?": "assets/voice/d4771d6ae660.mp3", "Olivia|Nothing! Wine's in the kitchen.": "assets/voice/4a47bfe543e5.mp3", "Christian|What's in the trunk?": "assets/voice/89eeed232519.mp3", "Olivia|Blankets. And things that are not blankets. Mostly blankets.": "assets/voice/1e03afb068c1.mp3", "Christian|Every year the tree is somehow exactly the same and exactly perfect.": "assets/voice/f44fd3d0cda4.mp3", "Christian|Merriweather Post Pavilion. Half of Columbia has a story that starts with a show on that lawn.": "assets/voice/f828b7209adf.mp3", "Christian|Churchill versus Wooton. The whole county picks a side whether they mean to or not.": "assets/voice/d5ec9d3a2b0d.mp3", "Christian|Cookbooks, a James Rouse biography, and three copies of the same thriller. This is the most Columbia shelf possible.": "assets/voice/2b04bb1f0583.mp3", "Christian|Snow coming down over Columbia. Somewhere out there Lake Kittamaqundi is freezing over.": "assets/voice/1544190a340d.mp3", "Christian|Kids drawings held on by magnets, leftover casserole, and exactly one fancy mustard. A proper family fridge.": "assets/voice/6bcbc658eb06.mp3", "Christian|Set for six, candles and everything. Nobody in Columbia does a casual holiday dinner. It is always an Event.": "assets/voice/4e977ca50147.mp3", "Christian|Who is a good cat. Who runs this entire house. It is Tre. It was always Tre.": "assets/voice/9bb19b52f0cc.mp3", "Christian|This plant is thriving. One of the Olivias has a serious green thumb. Or both of them. Still unclear how many Olivias.": "assets/voice/a054b800a59c.mp3", "Christian|A magnet card: DR. FRITZ \u2014 family dentistry. \"Olivia \u2014 don't forget your shift!\" \u2026Olivia works for a dentist?": "assets/voice/daa9b214c1e0.mp3", "Christian|All black everything. One Olivia is going through her midnight phase. Honestly? Commitment to a bit is respectable.": "assets/voice/a1a97a5e781f.mp3", "Christian|Bronze paisley, immaculate. The other Olivia is the exact opposite of downstairs blue-bedding Olivia. They really are two different people. Probably.": "assets/voice/9aa3cf341d08.mp3", "Christian|Two bedrooms, one hallway, zero answers about the Olivia situation so far.": "assets/voice/f02d95391027.mp3", "Christian|Hey \u2014 here to pick up the stuff for the clothes swap.": "assets/voice/69af7da61e5d.mp3", "Olivia|Thanks! It\u2019s that pile right there.": "assets/voice/6bf0912c8d6b.mp3", "Olivia|By the way \u2014 there\u2019s one more thing, but it\u2019s in the room across the hall. Do you mind grabbing it on your way out?": "assets/voice/96b6d97818bd.mp3", "Christian|Sure, no problem.": "assets/voice/6cb311c3a3c6.mp3", "Olivia??|Who are you?": "assets/voice/e2fb70fb31cb.mp3", "Christian|Olivia?? I just saw you \u2014 across the hall\u2026": "assets/voice/318907eb6589.mp3", "Olivia #2|I\u2019ve never seen you before in my life. But I AM Olivia.": "assets/voice/6244e1ca6bf0.mp3", "Christian|\u2026That\u2019s weird. Anyway \u2014 she asked me to grab something.": "assets/voice/12fc13b5d45c.mp3", "Olivia #2|Oh, you must be talking about Olivia. It\u2019s downstairs. Hey \u2014 since you\u2019re here, can you help take a quick photo?": "assets/voice/edc641a689cb.mp3", "Olivia #2|That\u2019s the one. Wait \u2014 yeah. That\u2019s the shot. \ud83d\udcf8": "assets/voice/4a20406576e3.mp3", "Christian|Honestly? Kind of a natural.": "assets/voice/88b28ff3f116.mp3", "Olivia #2|The item\u2019s downstairs, by the way. In the basement.": "assets/voice/10d266252ce0.mp3", "Olivia #2|You\u2019re wrong. That\u2019s \u2014 that\u2019s horrible. Take it again.": "assets/voice/0dcc4aa132b7.mp3", "Christian|Oh \u2014 hi. Tre?": "assets/voice/e9840118a016.mp3", "Tre|Christian.": "assets/voice/3f3ddc821f93.mp3", "Tre|You\u2019re probably looking for the last item. I\u2019ve been using it as a blanket, but \u2014 here you go.": "assets/voice/fcba19ec4b9c.mp3", "Christian|Thanks, Tre. Hang in there.": "assets/voice/2c507a0f0f3d.mp3", "Tre|It\u2019s warm down here. That\u2019s the thing people don\u2019t understand about basements.": "assets/voice/0692b6135ce2.mp3", "Christian|Two Olivias, a blanket-cardigan, and one unbothered Jim. Not bad for a Tuesday.": "assets/voice/335c90668971.mp3", "Christian|Cookbooks, a yearbook, and three identical copies of the same thriller. Classic.": "assets/voice/7620a10e2a54.mp3", "Jim|A crystal? Oh that tracks. She has them in every room. The moon ones are the good ones, or so I am told. Frequently.": "assets/voice/77e5fbcd4cbe.mp3", "Christian|You just... live with this.": "assets/voice/d930d7b5008e.mp3", "Jim|You learn to appreciate the full moon evenings. Very quiet house.": "assets/voice/8ad8afa17273.mp3", "Tre|*sniffs the crystal in your hand, deeply unimpressed*": "assets/voice/9d400e51b190.mp3", "Christian|Not food, buddy. Magic rock. Allegedly.": "assets/voice/929061c482f3.mp3", "Olivia?|Oh \u2014 you are doing the crystal thing. For her. Cute.": "assets/voice/d1ee039daf55.mp3", "Christian|You are... the other one. Do YOU lose crystals too?": "assets/voice/a5e446068416.mp3", "Olivia?|I never lose anything. That is one of the differences.": "assets/voice/10802f8da0c7.mp3", "Olivia|Eleven. Miami. Every tooth clean, the whole philly fam here \u2014 this is the best night of my life.": "assets/voice/5a4f90c6fa17.mp3", "The Fam|OLIVIA! OLIVIA! OLIVIA!": "assets/voice/a606d3dcb56d.mp3", "Christian|The floor is literally vibrating. E11EVEN does not do anything at half volume.": "assets/voice/c5c8bc63421c.mp3", "Christian|The wall is breathing with the bass. Somewhere an engineer is very proud of this wall. Correctly.": "assets/voice/d9e158f5e355.mp3", "Olivia|Bottle service up there. One day, bronco. Tonight we dance with the people.": "assets/voice/6d1fcc36379b.mp3", "Christian|Miami runs on three things: neon, bass, and the complete refusal to sleep.": "assets/voice/38962cc14cdf.mp3", "Christian|It is 3am energy in here and the night is young. The Philly fam does not mess around.": "assets/voice/215ec6cf7018.mp3", "Olivia|Careful bronco \u2014 you stare into the lasers, the lasers stare back.": "assets/voice/52f438fe94d0.mp3", "Olivia|One water please. Hydration is the whole game at Eleven.": "assets/voice/9d7238279952.mp3", "Tre|Bartender knows us by name now. That might not be good.": "assets/voice/7c2fe209915c.mp3", "Mark|Fabric and wire and pure audacity. People flew these before radio. Before parachutes, sometimes.": "assets/voice/57d7d0112d45.mp3", "Mark|Kitty Hawk, 1903. Twelve seconds of flight and the entire twentieth century happened because of it.": "assets/voice/a9ac9d9db804.mp3", "Christian|It looks like it is made of paper and hope.": "assets/voice/6d89915c939b.mp3", "Mark|It basically is. Muslin, spruce, and two brothers who refused to lose.": "assets/voice/8482ee373e11.mp3", "Mark|That is an actual piece of the moon. Apollo brought it back. People have been touching it for fifty years.": "assets/voice/e4df54569e9f.mp3", "Christian|I am touching the moon. On Christmas Eve. In the same week I hung clothes at a swap.": "assets/voice/62ebb69afd0b.mp3", "Mark|Range. You have range.": "assets/voice/fc664fd2f13b.mp3", "Mark|Lindbergh flew that \u2014 THAT exact plane \u2014 solo across the Atlantic. Thirty-three hours. No co-pilot, no bathroom, no backup plan.": "assets/voice/45d91c775fec.mp3", "Christian|No bathroom?": "assets/voice/141695654a01.mp3", "Mark|THAT is what you took from this story.": "assets/voice/4992a8be73c6.mp3", "Mark|Every gram on a rocket fights for its life. Engineering as a contact sport. Beautiful.": "assets/voice/8b50064e33fe.mp3", "Christian|You get this look on your face every time. Every single time.": "assets/voice/5cce64b85466.mp3", "Mark|They landed on the moon in something that looks like a craft project. Gold foil and grit.": "assets/voice/197153db2b4b.mp3", "Christian|Mark has now explained the lander to three separate strangers. The docents are taking notes. From HIM.": "assets/voice/e11bc79462b5.mp3", "Mark|The suspended gallery is the best room in DC. Fight me. Actually do not, I will cry about airplanes.": "assets/voice/8b60f1fb8553.mp3", "Christian|A whole ceiling of flying machines. This is Mark\\u2019s cathedral.": "assets/voice/84caed30bdf1.mp3", "Mark|When I was nine my dad brought me here and I cried at the X-15. Actually cried. In public.": "assets/voice/bbc7af931596.mp3", "Christian|You are tearing up right now.": "assets/voice/814d3711aeb7.mp3", "Mark|It is a VERY fast plane, Christian.": "assets/voice/cd562397e94d.mp3", "Mark|The paper airplane station. Aerodynamics for the people. Watch this \u2014 a perfect dart fold.": "assets/voice/fc68e38ee63d.mp3", "Christian|Steer with left and right, hold forward to keep lift. Through the rings!": "assets/voice/ad2443867b23.mp3", "Mark|FOUR-ring aerobatics! The Smithsonian should hire you. I mean it. I know the director. I do not know the director.": "assets/voice/3234bef0748c.mp3", "Mark|Respectable glide ratio! Bernoulli would nod politely. Try again \u2014 the rings are right there.": "assets/voice/531ee973f260.mp3", "Christian|The lawn dart approach. Bold. The floor appreciated it.": "assets/voice/d828f5bbc5c5.mp3", "Kylie|Wootton track. Two laps, seven hurdles, three very fast friends. Marathon prep doesn't care about feelings.": "assets/voice/76562ec5ba61.mp3", "Maya|New lap time or it didn't happen, Kylie. Ready\u2026 set \u2014": "assets/voice/7d31713eb441.mp3", "Maya|Okay that was actually fast. Same time Thursday, Kylie's Run Club forever.": "assets/voice/132fee0e24bb.mp3", "Kylie|SIX FOR SIX. In December-twenty-third traffic. Somebody get me a medal and a peppermint latte.": "assets/voice/7afd7756825d.mp3", "Christian|You are a shopping machine. Remind me to never race you at anything, ever.": "assets/voice/dc9938d94419.mp3", "Kylie|Out of time! I got\u2026 some of it. The rest is getting gift cards and pretending that was the plan.": "assets/voice/79c71093a9d8.mp3", "Christian|The Apple store at christmas. The line moves like geology. Somewhere in there a man is buying his third iPad by accident.": "assets/voice/f6629ec4df58.mp3", "Kylie|Do NOT let me go in there. I will buy a watch I cannot afford. Seriously, physically restrain me.": "assets/voice/cbccbe18dade.mp3", "Christian|The Nordstrom holiday window display. Someone designed this in June. Imagine being the person who draws reindeer in June.": "assets/voice/12c51b40f1f4.mp3", "Kylie|That cashmere in the window?? no. focus. LIST. The list is law.": "assets/voice/c998836451f1.mp3", "Christian|You can smell Lush from forty feet away. It is less a store and more a scented bomb shelter.": "assets/voice/1fdaac427ac8.mp3", "Kylie|Okay. December twenty-third. Six gifts, one store, no time. This is what marathon training is FOR.": "assets/voice/3ab6496c8317.mp3", "Christian|Grab only what is on the list \u2014 wrong items cost you time. Go go go!": "assets/voice/ae7f4c681cda.mp3", "Kylie|A mall tree in late December is just a big green stress meter.": "assets/voice/4f57651ffa08.mp3", "Christian|Lines to the back of the store. The true final boss of Christmas shopping.": "assets/voice/b984eec8b4c7.mp3", "Christian|The mustache man. Baltimore in a single frame.": "assets/voice/4efdde3fb76c.mp3", "Stacy|It is literally the law. Every rowhouse party has one. I think the city inspects.": "assets/voice/f4a7d17f37fd.mp3", "Christian|White marble steps. People really scrub these by hand?": "assets/voice/07f1a1069e30.mp3", "Stacy|For a hundred years, yes. Baltimore has opinions about its steps. Do not chip them.": "assets/voice/e7c7a12147b6.mp3", "Christian|A flyer: KYLIE'S RUN CLUB \u2014 Wootton High track, Thursdays. \"Marathon prep. Hurdles. No excuses.\"": "assets/voice/2faf04058231.mp3", "Kylie \u2764\ufe0f|You thinking about it? Because Maya is FAST and I need the practice. Come watch a lap!": "assets/voice/9daea6d40d17.mp3", "DJ|Yo \u2014 you want a turn on the decks? The booth is yours, bronco. Make something.": "assets/voice/805343998983.mp3", "DJ|You PUBLISHED it?? Bold. SoundCloud is gonna feel that one.": "assets/voice/741c46134c1c.mp3", "Stacy|Already liked it. Obviously.": "assets/voice/3dd74b004174.mp3", "Stacy|\u2014 and THAT is why you come to the swap this weekend \u2014 oh. You finally made it, babe! What took you so long?": "assets/voice/4941e63f92b6.mp3", "Christian|I don\u2019t even know where to start. Anyway \u2014 where do you want these?": "assets/voice/40e3f75dd934.mp3", "Stacy|Just drop them over there, babe.": "assets/voice/cfc882232719.mp3", "Christian|Oh \u2014 before I forget. I found some vintage cameras on the way. For you.": "assets/voice/6af426b206ae.mp3", "Stacy|Full collection energy. TikTok is going to lose its mind.": "assets/voice/8c575e7d2d33.mp3", "Christian|That\u2019s everything \u2014 even Tre\u2019s blanket-cardigan. May it find a loving home.": "assets/voice/a7b28c7ac950.mp3", "Stacy|You\u2019re the best. Okay \u2014 enjoy the party! DJ\u2019s actually good tonight.": "assets/voice/c86d09875a94.mp3", "DJ|Y\u2019all ready?? Match the beat \u2014 hit E when the ring closes!": "assets/voice/d1e1f17eff93.mp3", "Instructor|Welcome in. I\u2019ll call a pose \u2014 pick it before the breath ends. And remember: the swap clothes are watching.": "assets/voice/62a084c2ca82.mp3", "Instructor|That is\u2026 not that pose. But it IS a stretch of some kind.": "assets/voice/86ddc9051463.mp3", "Stacy|Hey \u2014 we\u2019re going to DC tonight with Mark and Kylie. You still remember that, right?": "assets/voice/1a675a251a01.mp3", "Christian|Of course.": "assets/voice/432b1c8dc5bb.mp3", "Stacy|Good. Then let\u2019s go \u2014 they\u2019re already down there!": "assets/voice/eadc118ac0bb.mp3", "Christian|A vintage Wootton letterman jacket. In perfect condition. Who gives this away?": "assets/voice/9d5c19988640.mp3", "Christian|This cardigan has seen things. Tre would love it \u2014 wait, he already has one.": "assets/voice/1d0ef3d31345.mp3", "Stacy|Babe. BABE. Look at this film camera strap \u2014 it matches one of yours!": "assets/voice/1ac4be8489b3.mp3", "Christian|Milk crates of vinyl. Somebody\u2019s whole 2009 is in here.": "assets/voice/ca6dddf6f2f8.mp3", "Maya|Careful with the pressing \u2014 that one\u2019s a first edition!": "assets/voice/e469b3032fce.mp3", "Christian|The Curated Rack. Vintage, high-end, everything labeled with the seller's name.": "assets/voice/d3c3f551aa9e.mp3", "Olivia|That leather jacket has your name on it. Well \u2014 someone's name. That's the point.": "assets/voice/9430ce60993f.mp3", "Christian|Matcha pop-up at a clothing swap. Baltimore you're doing the most, and I respect it.": "assets/voice/7194357f3735.mp3", "Christian|The belt never stops. Plates orbit the room like little sushi satellites. Somewhere a salmon nigiri has done forty laps.": "assets/voice/b2a6d914ea39.mp3", "Olivia|Rule one of belt sushi: if you hesitate, it is gone. Rule two: the good stuff always passes when you are mid-chew.": "assets/voice/a676cb55ae41.mp3", "Christian|The great wave. Every sushi place has one. It is basically a license to serve fish.": "assets/voice/54b62eb1d2ae.mp3", "Christian|Red lanterns, warm light, the whole room glows like the inside of a paper lamp. Downtown Crown does not deserve a place this cozy.": "assets/voice/69cbd309f5d8.mp3", "Christian|CLOSES AT 9. Underlined twice. It is a sushi place, not a nightclub.": "assets/voice/1b892301299d.mp3", "Olivia|They mean it too. Once they flipped the sign while I was mid-order. I respect it, honestly. Boundaries.": "assets/voice/a558b0a54a5c.mp3", "Kayla|You want to try the belt? Fine \u2014 watch the ticket, grab the plate it says WHEN it passes right in front of you.": "assets/voice/2aa0bed4017a.mp3", "Christian|Five orders. The bronco special had better be real.": "assets/voice/58663e8eb0a4.mp3", "Kayla|Press E as the right plate crosses the glowing grab zone. Grab the wrong plate and the itamae judges you.": "assets/voice/729ad8f955a2.mp3", "Christian|Pickled ginger, wasabi, the good soy. The wasabi-to-courage ratio here is deeply personal.": "assets/voice/1427fdc4eb56.mp3", "Christian|The sign that launched a hundred highway merges. Sacred text. The constitution of Gaithersburg.": "assets/voice/51d3d95c0c79.mp3", "Kayla|The salmon is the move. The bronco special is not on the menu, do not ask about the bronco special.": "assets/voice/38acdfa4432d.mp3", "Christian|Half of MoCo\\u2019s big decisions got made over conveyor sushi. Also at least three breakups per winter.": "assets/voice/ea4afc11baf8.mp3", "Kayla|Four. There were four breakups this winter. I count. It is the only joy I get.": "assets/voice/f9a981285d9a.mp3", "Christian|The belt keeps turning either way. There is a lesson in that.": "assets/voice/82232b8fd94a.mp3", "Kayla|The lesson is tip your server. We close at 9.": "assets/voice/add6e3c20109.mp3", "Kayla|Five-for-five off a moving belt. You are officially the bronco special.": "assets/voice/14386e4e8c23.mp3", "Christian|Tell the sign. The sign should know what I am.": "assets/voice/e23e2871d22c.mp3", "Kayla|Respectable belt work! You only mildly embarrassed yourself. Come back anytime before 9.": "assets/voice/05b742619491.mp3", "Kayla|You grabbed everything except the food. Impressive, in a way. We close at 9 \u2014 practice is over.": "assets/voice/ed8220a6a7cd.mp3"}